(The Custodian unfolds her home like a blossoming flower and draws the crate inside,) Tj
T*
(sealing it open again as a workshop. She breaks the seal. Inside lies a massive stone) Tj
T*
(carved with a lion's face. She goes still, then nods, slow and grave. "Of course Emeris) Tj
T*
(would keep this delivery quiet," she says. "This is the Keystone Asset: the heart-stone) Tj
T*
(for Hush's failing ward. If the route knew what you carried, every hungry thing in the) Tj
T*
(preserve would follow the scent of it." The light in her home dims as she speaks. "We) Tj
T*
(must take it to the Open Vale and revitalize the ward before Hush has to trust paper) Tj
T*
(promises instead of protection. That much magic will draw dangerous things from the deep) Tj
T*
(preserve. I will need your help.") Tj
